<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:07.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.360
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:28.980
<i>Despite acquiring the Hovercraft we called the Gallop, our overall battle strength didn't increase much.</i>

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:34.240
<i>Milady Sochie's competitiveness with Miashei Kune ended up overwhelming her...</i>

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:36.650
<i>And she chose to rush out into battle.</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.440
<i>The situation became chaotic as we went to rescue her.</i>

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:53.800
<b>Anis' Power</b>

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:15.940
You stupid birds! Cut out that noise!

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:40.010
It's rather strange, isn't it?

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.940
The enemy's Mechanical Dolls are completely out of sight.

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:46.260
You don't think the bombs we dropped blew em' up?

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.020
Ames, go for it!

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.310
Huh? You mean me?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.640
Show them the Luzianna fighting spirit!

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.770
Man, he loves to push his own people around.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:03:01.530
Even if it wasn't blown to bits, I bet they're not in fighting shape now.

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:07.320
Commander, there's no sign of them anywhere!

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.450
A tornado's bursting out of the ground!?

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:20.330
Shoot it, Ames! The mechanical doll's rising up next to you!

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:28.130
Commander Gavane!

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:29.840
Ames!

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:39.140
So this Dianna Counter frog-headed machine was hiding underground...

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.940
He deflected me?

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:53.540
It's some sort of monster!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.240
These jerks... Fall back!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.280
Why, hello there!

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.150
I take it you like that balloon?

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.810
Or maybe you just love anything that's beautiful?

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:22.780
What lovely feathers. You're a good bird.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.310
I bet even Dianna Soriel would love to have you.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:30.120
- Was it fixed?
- Yeah.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:35.080
Are you sure our Kapools should be the Borjarnon's only reinforcements?

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:39.710
Well, if you can delay the operation time a bit, we can send out the White Doll as well.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:43.830
It'll be alright. Sochie has Miashei to look after her.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:48.510
Mr. Ladderum, you have a lot of faith in your daughter. She must be spoiled.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.340
All of us fathers tend to share that stupidity.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:55.140
We received a message.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:57.100
It said the supply corps will meet us today, earlier than anticipated.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.440
Our logistics unit is becoming more and more reliable.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:03.740
Well, Guin's been increasing his factories' output, correct?

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:06.740
There's something that still bothers me.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.620
A problem?

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:13.240
It's that. There's somebody still living in an isolated house on top of that hill.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:23.420
Alright, that's enough with the sweet potatoes, go and till the wheat.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.130
Right!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.510
How long do we have to stay here, Jacop?

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.510
Don't forget that he's watching us...

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.210
That guy thinks he's such a big shot...

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:38.230
We never should've tried stealing anything from this place.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.940
That attack on Dianna even cost us our Gozzo units.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:44.860
Still, what do we do now?

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:47.450
How would I know that?

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.150
We'll look for a chance to flee.

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.740
That jerk's on to us!

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.580
What should we do?

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:00.710
The Mustache!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.630
- What should we do?
- What else? Run Away!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.920
That's right!

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:06.040
We'll hide in the house...

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:13.340
Um, excuse me, please? Could I ask something of you?

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:16.730
Is anybody living here? It's better if there isn't...

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.940
Who said nobody lived here?

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.810
Excuse me!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:25.310
Who's this fool who thinks they can force Anis Bell out of her home?

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.820
Is that Ms. Anis Bell?

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.730
Get yourself out of here!

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.410
This stupid mechanical doll...

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:37.750
Get this damn crop destroying mechanical bastard out of here! Get out, shoo! I'll kill you, damn it!

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:38.820
She's scary!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.290
Move it! Out with you! Get outta my sight you ugly ass eggplant machine!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:48.330
Doesn't matter if these machines walk or fly, I'll still...

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:52.920
Did you get a load of that?

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:57.180
Now you know why you'd better turn tail and run!

00:06:57.990 --> 00:06:59.810
l understand your feelings...

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.010
But still...

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.140
Don't come here!

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:06.820
Are you alright?

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.110
Did you hit your head, granny?

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:12.950
I'm very sorry, I didn't expect you to rush over like that.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:16.910
You're using your mechanical dolls and destroying my land!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.040
My name is Loran.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:23.210
You're the only person who has yet to evacuate this area, Aunty.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.500
So what's wrong with that?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.840
This place will become dangerous.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:31.540
The fighters from the moon will be passing through here. If you don't evacuate soon...

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:36.840
You all have bumps in the same place!

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.250
This bump...

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.020
What are you laughing at?

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.150
Ack, you're all stupid cowards.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.440
You'll be in danger if you don't leave.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.820
Aren't you the Moonrace's Laura?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.030
Yeah.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.940
What'll we do?

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:54.450
These people from that space race or whatever started causing trouble on my property...

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.330
After seeing this, I made them compensate me by staying and manning my fields.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.410
Help?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.250
Look and you'll understand.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:05.620
My ancestors would never forgive me if I fled and abandoned these fields for my own safety.

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:14.640
There's got to be some way to stop them...

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:17.180
About time those ladies from Inglessa showed up.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:23.520
Is the Mustache coming?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.730
We're part of our military's might as well!

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:29.440
It's a new enemy squadron. We've been defeated by their odd weapons.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.820
You'll assist us in our retreat.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:31.940
You're running away?

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.530
These guys are too powerful for us!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:36.120
Sir Guin sent us to give you this new secret weapon.

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.030
Let's try it out.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:44.330
What is that stuff?

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.050
It looks like powder a farmer uses to help fertilize the soil.

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:48.210
That's it, Sochie!

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.750
Get back!

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:07.520
Even the trees are burning? That's hot!

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.610
This is an explosive based on something that the Moonrace technicians manufacture.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:12.810
When ignited, it burns extremely hot.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:26.180
Who are these people!?

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:29.120
How can those mechanical dolls possibly have an ability like that!?

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:33.260
It doesn't matter if it's the Militia or the Moonrace.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:37.130
Both sides want me to flee my land so they can wage their war. Who are they kidding?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.140
I can see what you mean...

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.640
...but more mechanical dolls will soon be fighting in this territory.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.520
So you're saying I should just let them push me around?

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:49.020
But the riverside over that hill's already become a battlefield!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:52.110
I won't leave this place until I've fully tilled this crop.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:55.030
I'm sorry! In that case, I'll help you as quickly as I can.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.240
Let's get to it!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:57.610
Is that old woman serious?

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:02.330
No kidding. That old lady there is as stubborn as her donkey.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:06.390
So the pilot of the Mustache didn't come here to get us after all.

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:09.040
Wasn't that kid supposed to be a woman?

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:09.740
That's what I thought.

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:18.130
It doesn't look like we'll be having any problems with food and ammunition.

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.840
Miss Kihel, has Loran come back yet?

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.430
No, he hasn't yet.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:27.940
Now that I think about it, we should send the Gallop to reinforce them as soon as we've finished resupplying.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.230
We'll need the captain to return by that point.

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.020
I'll go get him.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.440
You, lady?

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.530
I'll take the car.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.610
Huh!? You know how to drive?

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.730
You didn't know that?

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.210
Dianna Soriel?

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.080
I don't believe it!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.840
Milady Kihel!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.340
Hurry up, Loran!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.130
She's his master?

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.070
She looks exactly like her!

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:02.930
Ladderum said the Gallop needs to reinforce them?

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:07.220
Sochie and the rest are having a rough time fighting against some strange opponent.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.430
I understand.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.220
But can we wait just a bit?

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.350
Hmm... Just a bit?

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:31.280
That's right, I am Loran's master.

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:36.150
That boy is honestly concerned for your well being.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:39.010
I think he's a little odd in the head, personally.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:42.340
Alright, this is the herb you said you wanted to to see.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:46.390
Sorrel? This grass is called Sorrel?

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.100
It's not a piece of grass, it's a herb.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.480
Like one you use in a salad.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:53.600
The people in Gauria make a herbal soup out of it. It's precious to them.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:58.010
There is a plant on Earth that carries my name...

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:02.200
And this is the Anise. It's the plant my name was taken from!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.410
It's a beautiful flower.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.110
It can be used to make cakes, and has a wonderful fragrance, just like me!

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:10.400
Living here must be magnificent!

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:14.420
The scent of the land and the water...

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:18.300
Sorrel... Wasn't that also the name of the Queen from the moon?

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.710
That's right.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:23.710
Perhaps that's the reason why a Queen from the moon would come down here...

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:32.880
The moon must also be filled with beautiful palaces and views. Why would she even need to come all the way down here at all?

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:36.190
Do you hate the Moonrace?

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:42.310
Anyone would hate a group that and blindly abuses and ruins their own land, even as they fight to protect it.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:45.610
So that's it.

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:51.410
1500 years ago, the land was scarred and useless. Nothing could grow here.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.790
But my ancestors purchased a form of black powder from prospectors...

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:58.590
...and with that, they worked very hard to care for and restore this land.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:03.290
l will never allow anyone to kill it again! Not even the Queen of the moon.

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:05.510
What took you?

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:08.010
I'm sorry, I was delayed a bit.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:10.800
My eyes aren't very good anymore, I can't read this very well.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.810
Huh, this music?

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:13.980
I thought this box was broken!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.190
I fixed it.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.980
What a meddlesome boy...

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.310
Read this to me.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.680
Sure.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:25.100
It's a letter from my daughter. I figured you can read it.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:30.700
Doesn't that Lady Kihel seem a lot like Queen Dianna?

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:33.620
I figured they came here to capture us.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:37.000
Hey, I have a great idea.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:42.000
I read you. The White Mustache's hovercraft should be somewhere near this area.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:46.210
- Right, that's exactly it! We'll flee on it...
- ...and we can take some wheat with us!

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.600
It bit me again!

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.800
Now you're in for it, you damn stupid Donkey!

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:56.940
Running around playing again...

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.400
Why did this have to happen!?

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.190
You shouldn't worry too much...

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.980
Everything will be alright.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.990
Is something the matter?

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:06.700
It's my daughter.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:09.700
She moved into the town to find work and ended up marrying a Baker.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:12.410
She even opened a new shop with him and had a granddaughter!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.490
Up until recently, they were doing fine. However...

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:22.200
Apparently, her husband was injured and she had help him recover.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:27.010
She says if it continues, her family and their servant will be forced out onto the streets.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.800
This is all because of the moon's army!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.800
It's because of Dianna Soriel's war!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:36.810
My poor miserable daughter fell into such miserable circumstances out in Nocis...

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:40.060
I have friends who live out there and they're still doing fine.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:44.110
Your daughter and her family could have gone off and found some other place to live.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:48.100
The letter doesn't say anything about that.

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.950
Aunty, there is one other letter.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.900
The postage is brand new!

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:57.290
"Mother, are you doing well?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.580
I've sent you this letter just after we evacuated the city."

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.210
Are you serious?

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.080
It's true!

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:08.880
"Our newest servant, Keith Laijie, now works with Bellerine and is a very talented man.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:12.090
I can now send a remittance once a week!"

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.680
You're making that up.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.390
It's all right here.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.100
l can't read or write, but you can?

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.390
It says that your granddaughter and Keith are off working together in the Sunbelt.

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.810
She's working now!? That poor soul.

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:28.900
No, the two of them are out there learning to make bread together.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:32.990
So this Keith was unable to run the business on his own?

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.990
It says they had to move out to a more populated area in order to sell their bread.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:41.000
It also says they want their grandmother to come celebrate and see their new business.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:46.290
You moron. That's my wonderful granddaughter. How can my daughter let some outsider just come in and take over their business?

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.300
l won't acknowledge it!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:51.590
"This servant is extremely dependable. I'm sure you'll like him.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.390
Take care of yourself, mother."

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:56.510
It's good that it wasn't all bad news.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.800
But she should have chosen a better husband!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.600
Was that a missile?

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.400
Loran?

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.980
Milday Sochie and the others must be in trouble!

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.440
Aunty, this place will soon become a battlefield.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.390
They're coming here!?

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:20.080
Muron, do you read me?

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.280
Yes!

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:24.580
After we get rid of the Militia...

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.590
We'll contact Commander Phil and have him deploy the harvesters.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.550
I wanna get revenge for that flaming attack they used!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.260
Just don't burn their farmland.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:33.800
Understood!

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.970
Wow! That color looks nice on you.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:42.090
We'll show those official forces from the moon that we of the "Red Team" are just as effective as they are!

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:47.310
We'll have to show them what we can do if we wanna get in Dianna Counter!

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:50.150
I get what you're saying, Captain Cancer.

00:16:58.340 --> 00:16:59.910
It changed its shape!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.900
Is it going to attack?

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:06.500
Sochie, we may be better off retreating!

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.800
Miashei's been hit!

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:16.470
Sochie, get away!

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:23.100
Miashei, are you okay? Stand up, Miashei!

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.390
Sochie, what is it?

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.100
Miashei isn't answering!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.230
Lady Sochie, get out of there!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.190
Miashei's been hit!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.440
If you're out there, get your butt over here!

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:44.410
There are so many Militia men around. Sneaking in there won't be easy.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.290
You idiot, they're only here to help resupply.

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.080
They'll leave after they've loaded on all the shipments.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.880
But doesn't that mean we should help move their stuff on the ship?

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.410
Ahh, I see.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:57.220
Come on, let's get out of here!

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:01.680
Even if the battle doesn't come here, you're dead if a bomb flies this way.

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:06.890
The best of my memories were made here.  I'll gladly die here with them if I have to!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:09.850
Look Aunty, even your donkey wants to escape!

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:15.100
I won't let those bombs destroy this!

00:18:15.100 --> 00:18:16.980
Stay away!

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:21.490
It's stupid to destroy this land!

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:22.370
Aunty!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:25.000
Where do you think your food comes from?

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.500
It grows from the ground thanks to the hard work of many people!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:32.000
You space bastards!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.960
You could never understand the importance of farmland!

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:38.170
Leave this place at once!

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:43.180
Is this the end?

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.010
- Not yet!
- What?

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:49.090
You should have chosen a better place to fight!

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.390
What the!?

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.610
Place retreat at once...

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.320
Or I'll use this saber to make quick work of him.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.700
The Mustached Mobile Suit?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.040
How does he know how the FLAT works?

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:17.550
I'm betting the Miltia's best Mobile Suit Ace would love to duel with us.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.090
l don't believe you!

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:22.010
You Mustache piloting Moonrace traitor!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:25.890
You'll simply kill that FLAT as soon as we back off!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.510
I never betrayed the Moonrace!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:36.400
You don't need to kick him so hard, Mustached lowlife!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:40.990
Our ancestors never forgot that they were members of the Moonrace!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:44.400
Next time, I'll make you pay for getting in our way!

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:49.290
Loran!

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:52.580
You were stepping on my land again.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:53.880
Sorry about that.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:57.420
Aunty, let me borrow some wood and cloth for making a stretcher.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:59.210
Did she break anything?

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:00.850
I don't know.

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:03.380
Is Sochie still all right?

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:09.220
Miashei's like that because I couldn't do my job. It looks like I'm the incompetent sister here.

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:11.310
Why are you talking about that now!?

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.890
She's badly injured.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:13.980
Sister?

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:16.400
Get that woman over here to help us.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:19.810
Gracious... If you want to stop the bleeding, put these herbs on her injury.

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:21.190
Okay.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.190
- Give it to her now!
- Right!

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:27.490
- Young lady!
- Yes?

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:29.610
Use this for a stretcher!

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:34.410
Hold it... you'll need the cloth to support it, right?

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:38.000
Milady Kihel, can you handle that?

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.500
I can handle it.

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.590
Use this.

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.210
Thank you very much.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.800
These Mechanical Dolls...

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:50.940
Thanks.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:52.590
Thank you very much.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:56.600
I told you I could handle it!

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:02.690
Sorry about all this. Looks like the Mustache saved my life once again.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:04.780
Will the little lady be alright?

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.200
Thank you, Gavane!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.910
Miashei is stronger than she looks.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:10.580
It should be okay for you to return to your battleship now.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:13.290
The enemy won't show up around here for a little while.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:16.080
Thank you very much, Mr. Gavane Gooney!

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.280
Sure. Goodbye, Laura.

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:31.510
I feel so humiliated about having to leave the battlefront like this.

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:32.390
Don't worry about it.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.270
Feel free to laugh at this stupid father.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:36.590
Nah, I won't laugh.

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:39.980
Come on, let's go.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.320
It's not just this land.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.940
There are many other places that will need your help.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:46.110
Take care of yourself.

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:48.110
That's right, Aunty Anis.

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:51.400
I intend to. Now get in!

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:58.120
- Goodbye!
- Take care!

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:02.000
Remember to find the bakery with my little companion's name on it!

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:04.500
We call him "Donkey"!

00:22:08.650 --> 00:22:12.890
Aunty, my friend is the one who's running that shop.

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:17.680
I'm sure Keith will be a fine grandson in law.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:39.740 --> 00:23:43.270
<i>Dianna may be quite humble, but she's still the Moon's queen.</i>

00:23:43.270 --> 00:23:45.980
<i>Now she wants to help care for the wounded...</i>

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:48.680
<i>and she ends up performing menial tasks like doing their laundry.</i>

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>The Militia seems to need all the help they can get. However...</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.910
<i>When I saw Dianna having to help with such labor, including surgery,</i>

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:57.400
<i>I asked myself "How can I help her?"</i>

00:23:58.220 --> 00:24:00.580
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN-A GUNDAM...

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:03.420
Dianna's Desperate Fight

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:05.500
<i>"We're going to earn a bubble filled wind!"</i>

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>Dianna's Desperate Fight</b>
